  "description": "Tags that belong to an area or a project (GM-107, supabase/migrations/0030_tag_scope.sql, docs/lists.md 'Tags'). A tag has at most one of 'area' and 'project'; with neither it is for everything. A tag whose area or project is not in 'areas' or 'projects' (deleted or unknown) counts as for everything. 'offered': the tags a filter's tag picker offers, in the tags' order: with no area and no project chosen, every tag; with an 'area' chosen, the tags for everything and that area's; on a project's board ('project'), the tags for everything, that project's and its area's ('projects' maps each project to its area, or null). 'groups': how Settings lists the tags: the tags for everything first ('place' null), then each area in the areas' order ('place' 'area:<id>'), then each project in the projects' order ('place' 'project:<id>'), tags in their order inside a group, and an empty group left out.",
